WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.200
The Long Term Plan or LTP is now open&nbsp;
for your feedback and guess what?

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.240
Here it is, we're trying to get&nbsp;
a summation in under a minute.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.960
Mayor Dan, rates, you're trying to keep them low?

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.440
Yes we are and Council's looking to defer&nbsp;
major or new projects where possible.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.960
But the District's still got issues, problems&nbsp;
that it will have to face over the next 10 years?&nbsp;

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.880
Yes there is and there are four key areas&nbsp;
that the Council will be focusing on.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:26.080
Don't want to put you under pressure,&nbsp;
but you've got 40 seconds, what are they?

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:32.160
They are ensuring our community facilities&nbsp;
can cater for our growing population.

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:36.400
Supporting Waimakariri's&nbsp;
Covid-19 economic recovery.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:41.680
Preparing for the impacts of climate change&nbsp;
and improving our District's sustainability,

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:45.840
and looking at how the Government's upcoming&nbsp;
three waters reform would impact us.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:51.920
That's four, well done! So that's&nbsp;
the LTP in a nutshell and we're going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:55.520
to have more information in coming&nbsp;
videos. Yes, there's coming videos.

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:59.600
To find out more visit&nbsp;
waimakarariri.govt.nz/letstalk

